<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Error - Intercity Portal</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #090d16;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .box {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid #243047;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    }
    .icon {
      font-size: 52px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 25px;
    }
    p {
      color: #aab4c5;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0 0 22px;
    }
    a {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: white;
      background: #3b82f6;
    }
    a:hover {
      background: #2563eb;
    }
  </style>
<style id="isp-light-theme-finish">body{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#f5f7fa 58%,#eef6ff 100%)!important;color:#101827!important}.error-container,.card{background:#fff!important;color:#101827!important;border:1px solid #e5e7eb!important;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(16,24,39,.08)!important}a,.btn{color:#0052cc!important}</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="icon">⚠️</div>
    <h1>Terjadi Kesalahan</h1>
    <p>
      Maaf, terjadi kesalahan pada Intercity Portal.
      Silakan coba kembali beberapa saat lagi.
    </p>
    <a href="/">Kembali ke Beranda</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

<style id="hide-customer-logos">
.logo,.logo-container,.brand-logo,.navbar-brand img,.brand img,.site-logo,.app-logo,.header-logo,[class*="logo"],[id*="logo"]{display:none!important}
</style>

<style id="customer-readable-finish">
/* Global readability pass: darker text, comfortable sizes, clear controls */
body{color:#172033!important}
p,li,td,th,label,span,div{line-height:1.5}
.text-muted,.muted,.small,.form-text,.help-text,.hint,.subtitle,.description,.p-sub,.footer,.footer-text{color:#5b6472!important;opacity:1!important}
input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder{color:#7b8492!important;opacity:1!important}
input,select,textarea{color:#172033!important}
button,.btn{font-weight:700}
table th{color:#374151!important}
a{font-weight:600}
@media(max-width:576px){
 body{font-size:15px}
 p,li,td,th,label{font-size:14px}
 .small,.form-text,.help-text,.hint,.description,.p-sub{font-size:12.5px!important}
 input,select,textarea{font-size:15px!important}
 button,.btn{font-size:14px!important}
}
</style>
